{"c":[{"id":"b12c5adbb4da292e","sum":"U1: panel frames are the content's; windows +24 pt for shadow except the desk (margin 0). ContrastRenderTests gate 4.5 text / 3 marks from pixels. Off-screen NSHostingView has no a11y tree: test via SlipSpeech. Setup: mkdir ModelRuntime/Vendor before copying llama.xcframework.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"caa08afcda9d84a4","sum":"U1: HostedPanel frames are the content's; windows are 24 pt larger for the drawn shadow, except interactive panels (desk: margin 0, system shadow). ContrastRenderTests measure token contrast from rendered pixels; a slip under 4.5 text / 3 marks fails there.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T205314Z-27bd8497da5b0b8f","text":"U1 v3: HostedPanel frames (size, pin, debugInfo) are the content's; the window is 24 pt larger for the drawn shadow, except interactive panels (the desk), which keep margin 0 and the system shadow so the margin never eats clicks.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T205315Z-15530fcef19ed7a7","text":"U1: token contrast is measured from rendered pixels by ContrastRenderTests (Tokens.hidden blanks one token; changed pixels are its glyphs, the hidden render is their ground); a token change that drops a slip under 4.5 text / 3 marks fails there.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1e56ade2067e19a9","sum":"Worktree setup: mkdir packages/keytype/Packages/ModelRuntime/Vendor before copying llama.xcframework, or Vendor becomes the framework. Off-screen NSHostingView has no a11y tree; test slip labels via SlipSpeech, count elements only on screen (VM).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T205315Z-c430e28338d1fa45","text":"Worktree setup: copying llama.xcframework into packages/keytype/Packages/ModelRuntime/Vendor/ when Vendor does not exist makes Vendor the framework (SwiftPM: 'does not contain a binary artifact'); mkdir Vendor first.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T205315Z-d04a530977d6b116","text":"U1: SwiftUI builds no accessibility tree for an NSHostingView that is not on screen (accessibilityChildren is empty even after cacheDisplay); test slip labels through SlipSpeech, count elements only on screen (VM).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"d3c90c2874f43484","sum":"B25: spaced eval calls need a fresh AbortSignal; realfill strips U+2731 from labels. Never-typed kinds: extend memory/sensitive.ts only. T2: writing marks bind to their checked sentence (an edit there drops one); range edits are AX-only (select, revalidate, verify), never paste.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"b1d476e32a92cb95","sum":"B25: eval writers that space calls need a fresh AbortSignal after the wait (a 15 s gap aborted every intent). The job form marks required labels with U+2731; realfill normLabel strips it (B24 scoreboards missed those four fields).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T211051Z-3925313f151b5275","text":"B25: eval writers that space calls must give the request a fresh AbortSignal after the wait; a 15 s gap aborted every intent in planner-eval's first GUI run.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T211051Z-9174d67891bff255","text":"B25: the job form marks required labels with U+2731; realfill normLabel strips it, and B24's scoreboards counted those four fields as not found.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"a514cda7aa8cec1f","sum":"Never-typed kinds live in memory/sensitive.ts (M1); extend it, no second list. T2: writing fixes are OfferKind.writing; a mark binds to its checked sentence, any edit there drops it; range edits are AX-only (select, revalidate, AXSelectedText, verify), never paste.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T211051Z-bc8230171f42cb4e","text":"B25: never-typed kinds (fill, planner, Ask) are memory/sensitive.ts, M1's classifier copied unchanged from v2/memory; extend that file, never a second list.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T212904Z-afa8d900ec44c553","text":"T2: writing fixes are OfferKind.writing; a mark is bound to its checked sentence (WritingMarks), so any edit in that sentence (or its '. ' before) drops it; range edits are AX-only (select, revalidate, AXSelectedText, caret back, verify), never paste.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
